🎓 “One Homeland, One Nation, One Flag&#33;” Challenge Launches&#33;

✔️ In celebration of November 18 — the Day of Adoption of the State Flag of the Republic of Uzbekistan — a creative challenge is being organized under the motto “One Homeland, One Nation, One Flag&#33;”

Within the framework of the challenge, teams from educational institutions can submit their creative entries in the following categories:

Videos dedicated to the history and significance of the State Flag;

Engaging quizzes on the colors and symbols of our flag;

Scientific experiments and exhibitions on the theme “The Flag and Science”;

Poetry readings, mini-plays, and theatrical performances centered on the Motherland, the flag, and national pride.

Post your videos and creative performances on social media using the hashtag #Bir_Vatan_bir_el_bir_bayroq&#33;

We encourage all educational institutions to actively participate in this challenge&#33;

Our State Flag is a vivid symbol of our independence, freedom, national pride, and the unity of our people&#33;

Note: The best submissions will be featured on the official social media channels of the Agency and its regional branches.

One Homeland&#33; One Nation&#33; One Flag&#33;

